    "minimum": "<strong>最低配置:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>需要 64 位处理器和操作系统<br></li><li><strong>操作系统:</strong> Windows 10 (64bit versions only)<br></li><li><strong>处理器:</strong> AMD FX 6300 @ 3.8 GHz, Ryzen 3 - 1200, Intel Core i5 2400 @ 3.1 GHz (MORE DETAILS HERE)<br></li><li><strong>内存:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>显卡:</strong> AMD Radeon R9 285, NVIDIA GeForce GTX 660 (2GB VRAM with Shader Model 5.0) (MORE DETAILS HERE)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX 版本:</strong> 11<br></li><li><strong>存储空间:</strong> 需要 46+ GB 可用空间<br></li><li><strong>附注事项:</strong> Video Preset: Lowest (720p)</li></ul>",
